---
import { defaultConfig, planMarkup } from '../lib/house-plan';
import { planViewBox } from '../lib/plan-artwork';
---

<section class="planner-section" id="planifica" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
  <div class="planner-inner" data-house-planner>
    <div class="planner-heading">
      <h2 id="planner-title">Dale forma a <strong>tu casa.</strong></h2>
      <p>Elige los ambientes, prueba una distribución y dibuja tus ideas. Después, conversemos sobre cómo llevarlas a tu terreno.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="planner-workspace">
      <form class="planner-options" aria-label="Opciones de tu casa">
        <h3>Tu casa de un piso</h3>
        <fieldset class="layout-choices"><legend>Distribución</legend><div>
          <label><input type="radio" name="plan-layout" value="compacta" checked /><span>Compacta</span><small>Ambientes agrupados</small></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="plan-layout" value="longitudinal" /><span>Lateral</span><small>Dormitorios a un lado</small></label>
        </div></fieldset>
        <label for="plan-area">Superficie interior <output id="plan-area-value" for="plan-area">96 m²</output></label>
        <input id="plan-area" type="range" min="84" max="180" step="1" value="96" aria-describedby="plan-area-help" aria-valuetext="96 metros cuadrados" />
        <p class="area-help" id="plan-area-help">Desde 84 m² para esta combinación.</p>
        <div class="planner-two-fields">
          <div><label for="plan-bedrooms">Dormitorios</label><select id="plan-bedrooms"><option value="1">1 dormitorio</option><option value="2">2 dormitorios</option><option value="3" selected>3 dormitorios</option><option value="4">4 dormitorios</option></select></div>
          <div><label for="plan-bathrooms">Baños</label><select id="plan-bathrooms"><option value="1">1 baño</option><option value="2" selected>2 baños</option></select></div>
        </div>
        <label for="plan-kitchen">Cocina</label>
        <select id="plan-kitchen"><option value="abierta">Abierta al estar</option><option value="cerrada">Separada del estar</option></select>
        <label class="planner-check" for="plan-terrace"><input type="checkbox" id="plan-terrace" checked /><span>Me gustaría una terraza</span></label>
        <button class="planner-secondary" id="plan-mirror" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Invertir distribución</button>
        <div class="planner-guide"><strong>Empieza con lo esencial.</strong><p>Las medidas son aproximadas. El equipo revisará la distribución, el terreno y los detalles para preparar tu proyecto.</p></div>
      </form>
      <div class="planner-preview">
        <div class="preview-heading"><h3>Tu distribución</h3><span id="plan-count">3 dormitorios · 2 baños</span></div>
        <div class="plan-view-options">
          <label for="plan-view">Vista<select id="plan-view"><option value="furnished">Con muebles</option><option value="technical">Solo distribución</option></select></label>
          <label class="dimension-choice"><input id="plan-dimensions" type="checkbox" checked /> Ver medidas</label>
        </div>
        <div class="planner-tools" role="group" aria-label="Herramientas de dibujo">
          <button id="plan-pen" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-1L20 7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4L4 15z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>Dibujar</button>
          <button id="plan-undo" type="button" disabled>Deshacer trazo</button>
          <button id="plan-clear" type="button" disabled>Borrar trazos</button>
          <button id="plan-zoom" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Ampliar plano</button>
        </div>
        <p class="drawing-help" id="drawing-help">Selecciona un ambiente para ver sus medidas, o activa “Dibujar” para marcar tus ideas.</p>
        <div class="plan-viewport"><div class="plan-board" id="plan-board">
          <svg id="plan-svg" viewBox={planViewBox(defaultConfig)} role="group" aria-roledescription="Plano interactivo" aria-labelledby="plan-svg-title plan-svg-description">
            <title id="plan-svg-title">Distribución aproximada de tu casa</title>
            <desc id="plan-svg-description">Casa de 96 metros cuadrados con 3 dormitorios, 2 baños, cocina abierta y terraza exterior.</desc>
            <g id="plan-geometry" set:html={planMarkup(defaultConfig)} />
            <g id="plan-strokes" aria-hidden="true" pointer-events="none" />
          </svg>
        </div></div>
        <div class="plan-room-detail" id="plan-room-detail" role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong>Explora tu distribución</strong><span>Selecciona un ambiente del plano para ver sus dimensiones.</span></div>
        <div class="plan-legend" aria-label="Referencias del plano"><span class="window-key">Ventanas</span><span>Muros y puertas en negro</span><span>Terraza fuera de los m² interiores</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="planner-share">
      <div><h3>¿Se parece a lo que tienes en mente?</h3><p id="plan-summary">96 m² interiores · 3 dormitorios · 2 baños · cocina abierta · con terraza exterior</p><p class="planner-note">El enlace conserva tus opciones y trazos. Puedes agregar más detalles al conversar por WhatsApp.</p></div>
      <div class="planner-share-actions"><button type="button" class="planner-secondary" id="plan-download">Descargar imagen</button><a id="plan-whatsapp" class="planner-primary" href="https://wa.me/56935172731" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cotizar esta idea</a></div>
    </div>
    <p class="planner-status" id="plan-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <noscript><p>Activa JavaScript para personalizar el plano. También puedes <a href="https://wa.me/56935172731">contarnos tu idea por WhatsApp</a>.</p></noscript>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/house-planner';
</script>

<style>
  .planner-section { padding: 86px clamp(16px, 3.5vw, 56px); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
  .planner-inner { max-width: 1424px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .planner-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .planner-heading h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 12ch; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.2vw, 64px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-weight: 500; }
  .planner-heading strong { display: block; font-weight: 700; }
  .planner-heading p { max-width: 43ch; margin: 0 0 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .planner-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(250px, .75fr) minmax(0, 1.7fr); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
  .planner-options { min-width: 0; padding: 32px; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
  h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.3; }
  .planner-options > h3 { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .layout-choices { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 26px; }
  .layout-choices legend { padding: 0; margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .layout-choices > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .planner-options .layout-choices label { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; justify-content: start; gap: 6px; padding: 12px 9px; margin: 0; border: 1px solid #62665f; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; }
  .layout-choices label:has(:checked) { border-color: var(--yellow); background: var(--ink-raised); }
  .layout-choices input { margin: 0; width: 15px; height: 15px; accent-color: var(--yellow); }
  .layout-choices small { grid-column: 1 / -1; color: #d5d8d2; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; }
  .planner-options label { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .planner-options output { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; }
  input[type='range'] { width: 100%; min-height: 36px; cursor: pointer; accent-color: var(--yellow); }
  .area-help { margin: 2px 0 23px; color: #d5d8d2; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .planner-two-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 21px; }
  select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; height: 45px; padding: 0 9px; border: 1px solid #62665f; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--ink-raised); color: #fff; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }
  .planner-options .planner-check { justify-content: start; gap: 10px; margin: 22px 0; cursor: pointer; }
  input[type='checkbox'] { width: 20px; height: 20px; accent-color: var(--yellow); flex: none; }
  button, .planner-primary { min-height: 44px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 16px; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 180ms ease-out; }
  .planner-secondary { border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }
  .planner-secondary:hover { background: #f0f1ef; }
  .planner-options .planner-secondary { width: 100%; border-color: #73786f; background: transparent; color: #fff; }
  .planner-options .planner-secondary:hover, .planner-options .planner-secondary[aria-pressed='true'] { background: var(--ink-raised); border-color: var(--yellow); }
  .planner-options :is(input, select, button):focus-visible { outline-color: var(--yellow); }
  .planner-guide { margin-top: 29px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #484d43; }
  .planner-guide strong { font-size: 13px; }
  .planner-guide p { color: #d5d8d2; margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .planner-preview { min-width: 0; padding: 27px 30px 22px; }
  .preview-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .preview-heading span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .plan-view-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px 22px; margin-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .plan-view-options label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .plan-view-options select { width: auto; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--line); padding-inline: 12px 28px; font-size: 12px; }
  .dimension-choice { cursor: pointer; }
  .planner-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .planner-tools button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; color: var(--ink); padding: 8px 11px; font-size: 11px; }
  .planner-tools button:hover:enabled { background: #f0f1ef; }
  .planner-tools button[aria-pressed='true'] { background: var(--yellow); border-color: var(--yellow); }
  .planner-tools button:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
  .planner-tools svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .drawing-help { margin: 10px 0 0; min-height: 1.5em; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .plan-board { width: 100%; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
  .plan-viewport { overflow-x: auto; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; scrollbar-color: var(--ink) #fff; }
  #plan-zoom { display: none; }
  .plan-board svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 640px; }
  .plan-board :global(.plan-room-target) { cursor: pointer; outline: none; }
  .plan-board :global(.plan-room-target:focus-visible rect), .plan-board :global(.plan-room-target:hover rect) { stroke: var(--yellow); stroke-width: 3px; }
  .plan-board.is-drawing :global(.plan-room-target) { pointer-events: none; }
  .plan-room-detail { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 15px 0; margin: 0 0 12px; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .plan-room-detail strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .plan-room-detail span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .plan-board.is-drawing { touch-action: none; cursor: crosshair; outline: 2px dashed var(--yellow); outline-offset: -2px; }
  .plan-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 20px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
  .plan-legend b { color: var(--ink); }
  .window-key { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .window-key::before { content: ''; width: 16px; height: 3px; background: var(--yellow); border-block: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .planner-share { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; padding: 27px 0 0; }
  .planner-share h3 { font-size: 20px; }
  .planner-share p { margin: 9px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .planner-share .planner-note { max-width: 66ch; font-size: 11px; }
  .planner-share-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; flex: none; }
  .planner-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--yellow); }
  .planner-primary:hover { background: var(--yellow-bright); }
  .planner-status { margin: 12px 0 0; min-height: 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  @media(max-width: 900px) { .planner-options { padding: 24px; } .planner-preview { padding: 24px 20px; } .planner-share { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; } }
  @media(max-width: 700px) {
    .planner-section { padding: 55px 16px 48px; }
    .planner-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 25px; }
    .planner-heading h2 { font-size: 39px; }
    .planner-heading p { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; }
    .planner-workspace { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .planner-options { padding: 24px 20px; }
    .planner-options > h3 { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .planner-options select { font-size: 16px; }
    .planner-guide { margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 17px; }
    .planner-guide p { max-width: 49ch; }
    .planner-preview { padding: 22px 12px 20px; }
    .preview-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; padding-inline: 4px; gap: 5px; }
    .preview-heading h3 { font-size: 19px; }
    .preview-heading span { font-size: 10px; }
    .plan-view-options { gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .plan-view-options select { font-size: 16px; padding-inline: 8px; max-width: 190px; }
    .plan-view-options label { font-size: 11px; }
    .plan-room-detail { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
    .plan-room-detail span { text-align: left; }
    .planner-tools { gap: 6px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .planner-tools button { padding-inline: 9px; font-size: 10px; }
    #plan-zoom { display: inline-flex; }
    .plan-board.is-zoomed { width: 640px; max-width: none; margin-inline: 0; }
    .plan-board.is-zoomed svg { max-height: none; }
    .plan-viewport:has(.is-zoomed) { max-height: 75svh; overflow: auto; }
    .plan-legend { font-size: 10px; gap: 6px 12px; }
    .planner-share-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; width: 100%; }
    .planner-share-actions :is(a,button) { font-size: 11px; padding-inline: 10px; }
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { button, .planner-primary { transition: none; } }
</style>
